# Architecture

The map is `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. The full rule is in `AGENTS.md`.

Decouple at real boundaries: domain modules, adapters for external services, and platform bindings. No speculative abstractions or single-implementation interfaces.

Modules talk through explicit public entry points. No deep imports across modules. `src/payload.config.ts` is the composition root.

Ponytail (`full`, `.agents/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md`) still applies. A new interface needs a second real caller or an external system. Otherwise keep the function that already exists.
